  <diagram id="E533aS7oxsh9Ow7dITYD" name="10. URL Redirection Workflow">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1935" dy="1128" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    participant User\n    participant Browser\n    participant LoadBalancer\n    participant RedirectService\n    participant RedisCache\n    participant MySQLDatabase\n\n    Note over User,Browser: User clicks &lt;i&gt;tiny.ly/Ab12Cd&lt;/i&gt;\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;LoadBalancer: GET /Ab12Cd\n    LoadBalancer-&gt;&gt;RedirectService: Forward request\n    RedirectService-&gt;&gt;RedisCache: Query Redis for &lt;i&gt;Ab12Cd&lt;/i&gt;\n    alt Cache Hit\n        RedisCache-&gt;&gt;RedirectService: Return original URL &lt;i&gt;https://example.com/long-url&lt;/i&gt;\n        RedirectService-&gt;&gt;Browser: HTTP 301 Redirect &lt;i&gt;https://example.com/long-url&lt;/i&gt;\n        Note over RedirectService,Browser: Browser opens destination\n    else Cache Miss\n        RedirectService-&gt;&gt;MySQLDatabase: Query MySQL for &lt;i&gt;Ab12Cd&lt;/i&gt;\n        MySQLDatabase-&gt;&gt;RedirectService: Return original URL &lt;i&gt;https://example.com/long-url&lt;/i&gt;\n        RedirectService-&gt;&gt;RedisCache: Update Redis with &lt;i&gt;Ab12Cd&lt;/i&gt; and original URL\n        RedirectService-&gt;&gt;Browser: HTTP 301 Redirect &lt;i&gt;https://example.com/long-url&lt;/i&gt;\n    end\n\n    Note over RedisCache: Cache Hit ≈ 95%\n    Note over MySQLDatabase: Cache Miss ≈ 5%\n    Note over RedirectService,RedisCache: Redis greatly reduces database traffic and improves response time.\n    Note over Browser: Version 3\n    Note over RedirectService: Redirect Flow\n    Note over RedirectService: Diagram 10 of 12&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="j73ZFIqNV9Zyco9G_iy--1">
